[{:adr/consequences "{:no_revenue_yet \"this ADR does not unlock revenue by itself -- actual PSP contracting is a\\n                   business/legal step, not a code change, exactly as it currently stands for\\n                   club-shinshi\", :governor_complexity \"materially more complex governor (HARD/SOFT tiers, human-approval\\n                        escalation, durable Store) -- real implementation work, not covered\\n                        here\", :shared_pattern_not_code \"net-babiniku and club-shinshi now share a monetization pattern\\n                            (not code); a future ADR could ask whether to extract a shared\\n                            PSP-adapter/billing library instead of duplicating the pattern\\n                            per product -- left open, not decided here\", :crypto_deferred \"USDC settlement remains deferred indefinitely, pending an etzhayyim-side\\n                    decision; not this ADR's call to make\", :out_of_scope_followup \"concrete adult PSP vendor selection, exact subscription/PPV/tip\\n                          price points, and the NSFW-tier go/no-go decision itself are\\n                          product/business decisions out of scope for this architecture ADR\"}", :adr/authoritative_for ["net-babiniku's paid tier reuses club-shinshi's proven OnlyFans-style creator-monetization\n    shape (subscription + PPV + tips, 80/20 creator take rate) rather than inventing a new\n    business model" "payment rail is fiat-only via an adult-friendly PSP (vendor gftdcojp implementable);\n    Stripe is not used (NSFW ToS conflict); crypto/USDC settlement is out of scope for this\n    (gftdcojp) repo per the standing vendor/etzhayyim centralization-axis boundary" "honest-default / no-fake-checkout: paid UI renders disabled/\"準備中\" until an actual PSP\n    contract exists -- this ADR does not authorize a checkout that appears to charge money\n    before real PSP integration" "governor upgrades from a flat allow/hold check to a HARD/SOFT-tiered policy modeled on\n    gftd-talent-actor's policy.cljc, with ledger migrated to the Store protocol shape" "NSFW LLM serving, if greenlit, reuses club-shinshi's self-fine-tuned Modal/vLLM pattern\n    (not a third-party API) with its hard-deny invariants and system-prompt parity\n    requirement, rather than re-deciding LLM vendor/infra from scratch"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "net-babiniku-creator-monetization", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2607051800-net-babiniku-vrm-vtuber-design.md" "90-docs/adr/2607051900-network-isekai-net-babiniku-broadcasting-integration.md" "orgs/gftdcojp/club-shinshi/90-docs/adr/2606010100-shinshi-ad-monetization-bmc.md.edn" "orgs/gftdcojp/club-shinshi/90-docs/adr/2606032100-shinshi-nsfw-chat-gemma4-modal-finetune.md.edn" "orgs/gftdcojp/app-aozora/90-docs/adr/0084-yoro-ads-integration.md" "orgs/etzhayyim/root/90-docs/adr/2605211950-vendor-centralized-etzhayyim-decentralized-substrate-axis.md" "orgs/etzhayyim/root/90-docs/adr/2605172100-etzhayyim-payments-on-chain-only.md"], :adr/status "proposed", :adr/id "adr-2607062200-net-babiniku-onlyfans-style-creator-monetization", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-06", :adr/decision "{:livechat_oshikatsu {:what \"broadcast-button-view stub (src/babiniku/ui/views.cljs:34-45) becomes the literal\\n          livechat entry point once ADR-2607051900's transport is implemented; tip/PPV\\n          prompts surface during an active livechat session\", :framing \"oshikatsu is the combination of subscription + tipping + livechat presence -- an\\n             operating pattern, not new technology\"}, :payment_rail {:what \"fiat only, via an adult-friendly PSP, vendor(gftdcojp)-implementable\", :not_stripe \"per user direction and org-wide NSFW ToS conflict precedent\", :vendor_selection \"CCBill vs Verotel vs Epoch vs Segpay is a business/legal contracting\\n                      decision, out of scope for this ADR, not resolvable in code\", :crypto_out_of_scope \"USDC/on-chain settlement explicitly out of scope for net-babiniku (a\\n                         gftdcojp repo); if wanted later must be implemented in\\n                         etzhayyim/root and consumed via a consent-capability boundary, per\\n                         the standing centralization-axis decision\"}, :content_tiering {:free \"existing SFW conversational-VTuber experience (Milestone 0 scope) unchanged, stays\\n          free\", :paid \"new tier on top, may include NSFW content -- same two-tier shape as club-shinshi's\\n          core-free/creator-paid split, not a full paywall\"}, :legal_compliance {:inherited_unchanged_from \"club-shinshi\", :requirements [\"特定商取引法 disclosure at go-live for the fiat paid tier\" \"mandatory 18+ age gate for any NSFW-tier content\" \"JP 刑法175 extraterritorial obscenity risk (same legal entity as\\n                   shinshi.club) + geo-block posture\" \"UK AVSA / French LCEN / US KOSA regional NSFW controls\"]}, :governor_upgrade {:hard \"non-overridable, immediate hold: existing blocked-terms/emotion/motion-cue checks,\\n          plus age-gate bypass attempts, plus any attempt to render a paid-content\\n          interaction when no PSP is provisioned (enforces honest-default structurally, not\\n          just in the UI)\", :soft \"human-approval-eligible: borderline content-tier ambiguity (SFW vs paid-NSFW-tier)\\n          -- escalates via an interrupt-before-style pause per talent.operation's StateGraph\\n          shape, rather than a hard reject\", :ledger \"migrate from a bare atom to the Store protocol shape (MemStore for dev/test,\\n            Datomic-backed for production), per talent.store\"}, :monetization_primitives {:subscription \"月額課金, per character, tiered Free/Sub/VIP, mirroring shinshi's\\n                  OnlineSalon.svelte redesign\", :ppv \"単発の限定コンテンツ/シーン購入\", :tips \"投げ銭, points-style micro-payment surfaced during livechat -- this is 'oshikatsu'\\n          in product terms\", :creator_take_rate \"80/20, OnlyFans-canonical, matching club-shinshi\"}, :honest_default {:rule \"until an actual PSP contract exists, every paid-looking control (subscribe/tip/PPV)\\n          renders disabled/準備中 -- this ADR does not authorize a checkout UI that appears\\n          to charge money before real PSP integration exists\", :precedent \"ADR-0084 (yoro ads integration honest-default pattern), inherited unchanged\"}, :nsfw_llm_serving {:if \"only if/when the paid NSFW tier is greenlit\", :what \"reuse club-shinshi's pipeline: self-fine-tuned model served on Modal/vLLM, same\\n          hard-deny categories and system-prompt parity invariant -- do not re-decide LLM\\n          vendor/infra from scratch\"}, :business_ledger_registration {:when \"follow-up, not done by this ADR\", :how \"register net-babiniku.* entries in 90-docs/business/canvas-ledger.edn via the\\n         normal 70-tools/bmc advisor/gate tooling (append-only event log produced by that\\n         tool, not hand-edited), including a PSP-gate entry shaped like club-shinshi's frozen\\n         PSP/crypto-rail gate\"}}", :db/id -1, :adr/problem "{:source \"user direction 2026-07-06: raise net-babiniku's maturity to a full VTuber platform\\n           where the talent is an LLM (not a human) doing livechat/conversation/motion, with\\n           livechat, oshikatsu, tips (投げ銭), monthly subscription (月額課金), run in the same\\n           operating style as OnlyFans\", :clarifying_answers {:content_rating \"tiered -- free SFW core chat stays free; a paid tier may include NSFW\\n                    content\", :payment \"an adult-content-compatible PSP, integrated separately, not Stripe\", :turn_scope \"ADR only, no code this turn\"}, :current_state {:net_babiniku \"Milestone 0: kami-webgpu render loop, flat babiniku.governor/review-turn\\n                  (blocked-terms/allowed-emotions/allowed-motion-cues), atom-backed\\n                  append-only ledger, broadcast-button-view UI stub (console.log only,\\n                  src/babiniku/ui/views.cljs:34-45), no LLM backend, no TTS, no real chat\", :adr_2607051800 \"explicitly scoped out LLM provider(s), pricing/currency model, and\\n                    moderation policy detail as follow-up\", :adr_2607051900 \"covers only RTMP/WebRTC streaming transport to Twitch/YouTube/OBS, no\\n                    monetization\", :canvas_ledger \"net-babiniku has no entry yet in 90-docs/business/canvas-ledger.edn\"}, :prior_art {:club_shinshi {:what \"gftdcojp/club-shinshi (shinshi.club), live, already runs almost exactly this\\n           model\", :monetization \"ADR-2606010100 + amendments (b)(c): AI characters recast as OnlyFans-style\\n                   creators -- monthly subscription + PPV + tips (Shinshi Points), 80/20\\n                   creator take rate, core viewing/1:1-chat/search stays free+ad-supported\\n                   (creator payment is an opt-in upsell, not a full paywall)\", :psp_gate \"Stripe already ruled out for NSFW org-wide; paid creator layer blocked until an\\n               adult-friendly PSP (CCBill/Verotel/Epoch/Segpay) is actually contracted; until\\n               then all paid UI renders 準備中, never a fake checkout (ADR-0084 honest\\n               default)\", :dual_rail \"fiat rail: MoR = gftd, vendor-repo implementable (standing 'payment\\n                counterparty is always gftd' decision). crypto/USDC rail: out of bounds for\\n                any gftdcojp repo -- self-custody on-chain settlement must live in\\n                etzhayyim/root per the centralization-axis boundary (ADR-2605211950,\\n                ADR-2605172100)\", :legal \"特定商取引法 disclosure required for fiat tier at go-live; JP 刑法175\\n            extraterritorial obscenity risk (FC2 precedent) + geo-block; UK AVSA / French\\n            LCEN / US KOSA regional NSFW controls\", :nsfw_llm \"ADR-2606032100: self-fine-tuned gemma-4-26B-A4B (bf16 LoRA) served on\\n               Modal/vLLM, not a third-party API (third-party APIs categorically refuse\\n               in-character adult roleplay); hard invariants preserved even uncensored (no\\n               minors, no real persons, no non-consent, 3-stage 18+ age gate, mandatory AT\\n               self-label); train/inference system-prompt byte-parity is non-negotiable\"}, :gftd_talent_actor {:policy \"talent.policy: 6-tier HARD/SOFT violation model (RBAC/purpose-limitation/\\n             fairness/minimal-disclosure = HARD non-overridable; confidence-floor/high-stakes\\n             = SOFT human-approval-eligible) -- richer than net-babiniku's flat check\", :store \"talent.store: Store protocol (MemStore / DatomicStore, same contract) for the\\n            append-only ledger\", :operation \"talent.operation: langgraph-clj StateGraph with interrupt-before\\n                #{:request-approval} for human-in-the-loop escalation\"}, :billing_precedent [\"orgs/gftdcojp/net-kotobase/clj-edge/src/kotobase/billing.cljc -- webhook to pure\\n     function to KV persistence pattern for subscription-tier state\" \"orgs/kotoba-lang/com-stripe/src/stripe/main.cljc -- clean-room Stripe entity schema\\n     (Customer/Subscription/PaymentIntent/Charge/Refund/Invoice/Product/Price), usable as the\\n     internal domain schema regardless of which PSP actually settles funds\"]}}", :adr/alternatives "[{:option \"design NSFW-chat/monetization from scratch for net-babiniku, independent of\\n            club-shinshi\", :rejected_because \"club-shinshi already has a live, hard-won precedent (PSP research, LLM\\n                      fine-tune, legal disclosure requirements); duplicating that research\\n                      wastes effort and risks inconsistent compliance posture across two\\n                      gftdcojp adult-adjacent products\"} {:option \"use Stripe for the paid tier\", :rejected_because \"Stripe's ToS prohibits adult content; already established precedent in\\n                      this repo (club-shinshi ADR-2606010100 Goal section)\"} {:option \"implement crypto/USDC settlement directly in net-babiniku\", :rejected_because \"violates the standing vendor/etzhayyim centralization-axis boundary\\n                      (ADR-2605211950, ADR-2605172100); gftdcojp repos may not implement\\n                      on-chain settlement\"} {:option \"skip the HARD/SOFT governor upgrade, keep the flat review-turn check\", :rejected_because \"monetized NSFW content raises containment stakes past what a flat\\n                      allow/hold check can safely arbitrate (age-gate bypass, payment-adjacent\\n                      prompts need non-overridable HARD holds); talent.policy's pattern is\\n                      proven and directly reusable\"}]", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607062200: net-babiniku -- LLM-driven VTuber creator monetization (livechat,\n          oshikatsu, tips, subscription, OnlyFans-style operation)"}]